#: src/Admin/Menu.php:30
msgid "Welcome to RowSprout"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Menu.php:31
msgid "RowSprout turns one template and a table of rows into as many pages as you need: for example a page for every service in every city you work in. Each page gets its own title, URL, texts and links, and stays a normal WordPress page."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Menu.php:49
msgid "Build a template"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Menu.php:50
msgid "Design the page once in your favorite editor, there are widgets for the block editor, Elementor and WPBakery. This is the layout every generated page shares."
