msgid "Add properties"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Menu.php:54
msgid "Properties are the parts that differ per page: a title, a URL, a text, a link, an email address. Place a property in your design with its code (shown on the Properties tab, for example @code_city_123@) or with one with the widgets."
